# Gemini API key for the Decisions API (intent classification).
# Get one free at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# Client-side (Vite) — exposed to the browser. Only use for demos;
# for production, route through the Bun proxy instead.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Server-side (Bun proxy) — keeps the key out of the client bundle.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
